// DOCUMENTATION:
// --------------
// This SCL file is a 1:1 conversion from TIA Portal V18 GRAPH XML.
// All logic elements have been preserved exactly as they appear in XML.
//
// Elements IGNORED (UI-only, no runtime effect):
//   - Wire, Wires: Visual connections in editor
//   - Parts, FlgNet: LAD network visualization
//   - Powerrail: Power supply visualization
//   - Position, View, Zoom: Editor layout
//   - Branch, BranchRef: Editor branching
//   - Connection, NodeFrom, NodeTo, LinkType: Connection graph
//   - IdentCon, NameCon, OpenCon: Connector names
//
// Elements PRESERVED (runtime-relevant):
//   - Step.Number, Step.Actions: State and actions
//   - Transition.Number, Transition.Token: Transition conditions
//   - Interlock.Token: Step entry conditions
//   - Supervision.Token: Step monitoring
//
// For full analysis, see: GRAPH_TO_SCL_ANALYSIS.txt
